    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warning:\u00a0This game doesn't have a save system (which will be added in a future update). If you collect items and do not enter inspection mode, the game may encounter a bug, requiring you to restart the game ( milk bottle, heart, and gun are exempt from this issue).\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;K.I.D.N.A.P&quot;</strong> is a psychological horror game where you play as a kidnapped victim trying to escape from a mysterious room by solving puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an ordinary young man who, one day, wakes up to find yourself kidnapped and trapped in an old, decayed room with an eerie atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No matter what, you must find a way out. In this unfamiliar and terrifying environment, you must solve puzzles, survive, and escape. However, this room is not the only place you will encounter. Whatever awaits you beyond, good luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle-solving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escaping from locked rooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finding a way out of the labyrinth</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warning:\u00a0This game doesn't have a save system (which will be added in a future update). If you collect items and do not enter inspection mode, the game may encounter a bug, requiring you to restart the game ( milk bottle, heart, and gun are exempt from this issue).\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;K.I.D.N.A.P&quot;</strong> is a psychological horror game where you play as a kidnapped victim trying to escape from a mysterious room by solving puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an ordinary young man who, one day, wakes up to find yourself kidnapped and trapped in an old, decayed room with an eerie atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No matter what, you must find a way out. In this unfamiliar and terrifying environment, you must solve puzzles, survive, and escape. However, this room is not the only place you will encounter. Whatever awaits you beyond, good luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle-solving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escaping from locked rooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finding a way out of the labyrinth</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "K.I.D.N.A.P is a psychological horror puzzle game. You play as an ordinary man who has been kidnapped and trapped in a rundown, old-fashioned room. In this eerie environment, you must find a way to escape by solving puzzles\u2014or doing whatever it takes. Good luck.",
